        "description": "Abnormal nerve conduction studies indicating peripheral neuropathy",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive cerebellar ataxia and bilateral sensorineural hearing loss with supportive findings such as optic atrophy or family history",
